message: >-
  If you use this exploratory code or analysis, please cite
  the repository. This project is not peer-reviewed.

title: "An Archival Investigation of the Close-Pair Candidate J1237+3314"

type: software

authors:
  - family-names: Akella
    given-names: Yashaswy

abstract: >-
  An exploratory archival investigation of the known close-pair
  candidate J1237+3314 using radio-optical astrometry and
  spectroscopy. The physical association remains unresolved.

keywords:
  - astronomy
  - quasars
  - spectroscopy
  - archival research